# Firmware stand-ins for the lecroy-logicstudio model
# (emu/src/models/lecroy-logicstudio.rs): the FX2 firmware the scan
# uploads and the two FPGA bitstreams. The FX2 size is the model's; the
# bitstreams are FPGA_FIRMWARE_SIZE (protocol.c), the only size the
# driver accepts. A unit test checks the list against the model; the
# real files (extracted from LeCroy's software) are not available here,
# and the model checks the stand-ins byte for byte.
lecroy-logicstudio16-fx2lp.fw 6214
lecroy-logicstudio16-8.bitstream 464196
lecroy-logicstudio16-16.bitstream 464196
